   "body": "**Capture result** (PR #435, 2026-11-02): `R98a`. HFR has no account-deletion page or URL of its own. Every forum page's footer links `https://www.hardware.fr/html/donnees_personnelles/` (\"Signaler un contenu illicite / Données personnelles\"), which states the GDPR rights including erasure, exercised by e-mail to a dedicated address or by post to the DPO (name, first name, customer number, copy of an ID). That URL is what LOT-157 (#247) links (Q-10: no address in the app). Recorded in HFR-PROTOCOL §6b.",
